 'Sixteen Tris-HCl occurrences split into seven weighed salt contexts, six 1 M pH 7.5 stocks, two 0.5 M pH 8.0 stocks and one final-medium 50 mM pH 7.8 context. The solid salt receives the filed #1238 grade correction. NEW-03 removes inferred material components from the two buffer stocks; their positive concentration/pH specifications remain.',
 'TOGO M2410 names a weighed HEPES reagent in BSK II. DSMZ 975 independently lists 2.38 g HEPES (10mM) in one liter of receiving medium, so that inherited concentration label is a weighed input with a final-medium qualifier, not evidence of a supplied 10 mM stock.',
