 'The historical KJ stock context remains unidentified beyond its source label and strength; inconsistent provider phencyclidine metadata is rejected as evidence. Separately DSMZ 792b positively shows that KI (0.01% w/v) is a supplied aliquot, supporting its removal as an exact synonym on neat KI without resolving KJ.',
